blurb = "Depicts a takarabune (\"treasure ship\"), a mythical vessel from Japanese folklore, believed to sail into port during the first three days of the New Year, carrying the Seven Lucky Gods. It symbolizes good fortune, wealth, and prosperity, with roots in the Edo period when people placed pictures of it under their pillows for a lucky first dream."
